OL,3,AAnthropic to raise $64bn in major stock
OL,4,Amarket listing
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic, the AI company behind the
OL,7,FClaude chatbot, is planning to raise up
OL,8,Fto $64bn (#48bn) when it lists its
OL,9,Fshares for sale on New York's Nasdaq
OL,10,Fstock exchange.
OL,12,FThe loss-making company said it will
OL,13,Foffer its shares for between $70 and
OL,14,F$78 each in its initial public offering
OL,15,F(IPO), which is expected to go ahead
OL,16,Fthis month.
OL,18,FThis would value Anthropic at between
OL,19,F$1.1 trillion and $1.3 trillion which,
OL,20,Falthough large, is below the $2
OL,21,Ftrillion some analysts had predicted
OL,22,Fweeks ago.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
