OL,3,AAnthropic to raise $64bn in major stock
OL,4,Amarket listing
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is floating at a volatile time for
OL,7,FAI firms. After last week's US midterm
OL,8,Felections, the Nasdaq fell sharply on
OL,9,Fconcerns a Democrat-led Congress could
OL,10,Fslow development of AI and the buildout
OL,11,Fof data centres.
